ID   1.1.1.47
DE   glucose 1-dehydrogenase [NAD(P)(+)].
CA   (1) D-glucose + NADP(+) = D-glucono-1,5-lactone + NADPH + H(+).
CA   (2) D-glucose + NAD(+) = D-glucono-1,5-lactone + NADH + H(+).
CC   -!- This enzyme has similar activity with either NAD(+) or NADP(+). cf.
CC       EC 1.1.1.118 and EC 1.1.1.119.
