ID   1.7.2.2
DE   nitrite reductase (cytochrome; ammonia-forming).
AN   cytochrome c552.
AN   cytochrome c nitrite reductase.
AN   multiheme nitrite reductase.
CA   6 Fe(III)-[cytochrome c] + NH4(+) + 2 H2O = 6 Fe(II)-[cytochrome c] +
CA   nitrite + 8 H(+).
CC   -!- The enzyme also reduces nitric oxide and hydroxylamine to ammonia,
CC       and sulfite to sulfide.
